        "quote": "In an action to recover damages for personal injuries, the defendant Dong's Family Cuisine appeals from an order of the Supreme Court, Queens County (Frederick D.R. Sampson, J.), entered December 2, 2019. The order denied that branch of the motion of the defendant Dong's Family Cuisine which was for summary judgment dismissing the complaint insofar as asserted against it.",
